{'symbol': 'STT', 'date': '2021-10-12 08:30:00', 'title': 'STATE STREET ANNOUNCES EXPANSION OF DIRECT ACCESS LENDING', 'text': 'BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--STATE STREET CORPORATION (NYSE: STT) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS EXPANDED UPON ITS MARKET LEADING PEER-TO-PEER SECURITIES FINANCE PRODUCT, DIRECT ACCESS LENDING -- WHICH ENABLES DIRECT, PRINCIPAL LOANS BETWEEN ITS LENDING CLIENTS AND ITS BORROWING CLIENTS – TO NOW ALLOW BORROWERS TO POST US CONVERTIBLE BONDS AS COLLATERAL TO FACILITATE NEW CLIENTS AND STRATEGIES ENTERING THE PROGRAM. THE MANAGED PEER-TO-PEER PRODUCT HAS GROWN SUBSTANTIALLY SINCE PRODUCT LAUNCH IN Q4 2019 ADD'}